{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>El</b> — The heh is attached with a maqef to the resh of 'ra,' and likewise the meaning: do not say to repay evil to those who do evil to you." "<b>Qaveh to HaShem</b> — who has power to repay him recompense, and He will save you from their hand."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:51.941744653Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}